(4963287, 722631, 66648, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors and reflections in this beautiful image. Very nice long exposure. I love how you lighted the surroundings.<br/> <br/>10/10. Good job!</td>', 'I really love the colors and reflections in this beautiful image. Very nice long exposure. I love how you lighted the surroundings. 10/10. Good job!', '2008-09-19 02:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
