(4963431, 721904, 68546, '<td valign="top">One of my two 10''s in this challenge. This is awesome! straight out of camera and it looks like a piece of Photoshop art! love it</td>', 'One of my two 10''s in this challenge. This is awesome! straight out of camera and it looks like a piece of Photoshop art! love it', '2008-09-19 06:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963432, 722289, 68546, '<td valign="top">one of my two 10''s in the challenge, just goes to show not everything needs photoshop! would have prefered a tiny bit more light on the digger but I love the shot</td>', 'one of my two 10''s in the challenge, just goes to show not everything needs photoshop! would have prefered a tiny bit more light on the digger but I love the shot', '2008-09-19 06:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963433, 721382, 68546, '<td valign="top">very clever and nicely executed - 9</td>', 'very clever and nicely executed - 9', '2008-09-19 06:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963434, 722770, 68546, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene. Love the composition and exposure, another great example of good photography without photoshop</td>', 'Awesome scene. Love the composition and exposure, another great example of good photography without photoshop', '2008-09-19 06:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963435, 721908, 68546, '<td valign="top">very well done! nicely exposed in the car and fantastic motion outside the car. I love these ultra wide inside the car shots and this is a very good example especially with no editing!</td>', 'very well done! nicely exposed in the car and fantastic motion outside the car. I love these ultra wide inside the car shots and this is a very good example especially with no editing!', '2008-09-19 06:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4963436, 722690, 68546, '<td valign="top">Nice Westfield! Similar shot to my PB in Acronyms so I know how hard these are. Westfield have a great tripod stabaliser in the boot box and roll bar though don''t they!  I look forward to seeing your details after the challenge but congrats on a lovely motion shot on a road Westfields are made for!</td>', 'Nice Westfield! Similar shot to my PB in Acronyms so I know how hard these are. Westfield have a great tripod stabaliser in the boot box and roll bar though don''t they!  I look forward to seeing your details after the challenge but congrats on a lovely motion shot on a road Westfields are made for!', '2008-09-19 06:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
