(4964519, 722786, 67152, '<td valign="top">the way the lights seem to meander down the river is a nice effect, but there is so little detail beyond the lights, making it a bit less than ideal - some more light from the sky for us to see the horizon and trees beyhond and some details in the foreground with light painting could have really helped this out</td>', 'the way the lights seem to meander down the river is a nice effect, but there is so little detail beyond the lights, making it a bit less than ideal - some more light from the sky for us to see the horizon and trees beyhond and some details in the foreground with light painting could have really helped this out', '2008-09-19 16:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964523, 721938, 67152, '<td valign="top">an interestng take - the yellowish and red colors really are unsettling - and i imagine this is the intent here -not sure i really like it except for the way the eyes are staring us down</td>', 'an interestng take - the yellowish and red colors really are unsettling - and i imagine this is the intent here -not sure i really like it except for the way the eyes are staring us down', '2008-09-19 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964524, 722701, 67152, '<td valign="top">the choice of longer exposure here in this setting allows for us to see the clouds, but without a specific subject of interest to focus on, it really does not draw us in</td>', 'the choice of longer exposure here in this setting allows for us to see the clouds, but without a specific subject of interest to focus on, it really does not draw us in', '2008-09-19 16:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964528, 722865, 67152, '<td valign="top">i see the blur of motion but it really does come across as interesting or appealing to me</td>', 'i see the blur of motion but it really does come across as interesting or appealing to me', '2008-09-19 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964530, 722295, 67152, '<td valign="top">the motion of the cars in the race so they are ghostlike and the presence of the fire extinquisher in the field of play to provide both a hazard and a safety measure make for a quirky and cool feel</td>', 'the motion of the cars in the race so they are ghostlike and the presence of the fire extinquisher in the field of play to provide both a hazard and a safety measure make for a quirky and cool feel', '2008-09-19 16:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964548, 722787, 55876, '<td valign="top">Smoking!!!!</td>', 'Smoking!!!!', '2008-09-19 16:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964560, 722780, 67152, '<td valign="top">the brownish light, the thick reflection from the moon, the wispy grasses in the foreground - all cool elements</td>', 'the brownish light, the thick reflection from the moon, the wispy grasses in the foreground - all cool elements', '2008-09-19 16:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964562, 722757, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice sharp image - i almost didn''t pick up the boat steaming through the first time i saw the image</td>', 'nice sharp image - i almost didn''t pick up the boat steaming through the first time i saw the image', '2008-09-19 16:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964564, 721886, 67152, '<td valign="top">The number and shape of the repeating shapes is quite moving and pretty well captured<br/> <br/>the extent of the title details is a bit overdone however</td>', 'The number and shape of the repeating shapes is quite moving and pretty well captured the extent of the title details is a bit overdone however', '2008-09-19 16:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964566, 722758, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very cool image - i like how there is no traffic in the passing lanen, how the tail lights look like crayons, and how the headlights look like lasers</td>', 'a very cool image - i like how there is no traffic in the passing lanen, how the tail lights look like crayons, and how the headlights look like lasers', '2008-09-19 16:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964567, 722111, 67152, '<td valign="top">rich tones and colors on the observation deck here - nicely done</td>', 'rich tones and colors on the observation deck here - nicely done', '2008-09-19 16:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964638, 722711, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''d have spent a little more time finding a more pleasing scene. Something with a stronger composition and less random clutter.</td>', 'I''d have spent a little more time finding a more pleasing scene. Something with a stronger composition and less random clutter.', '2008-09-19 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964639, 721938, 97166, '<td valign="top">haha.. the eyes on the side of the head cement this one for me.</td>', 'haha.. the eyes on the side of the head cement this one for me.', '2008-09-19 17:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964642, 722724, 97166, '<td valign="top">kind of chaotic, but not in a good way.</td>', 'kind of chaotic, but not in a good way.', '2008-09-19 17:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964643, 721904, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the painted effect in the treetops.</td>', 'I''m loving the painted effect in the treetops.', '2008-09-19 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964645, 722906, 97166, '<td valign="top">That power line hurts this.</td>', 'That power line hurts this.', '2008-09-19 17:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964646, 722487, 97166, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt, but the pose is wrong ;)</td>', 'A nice attempt, but the pose is wrong ;)', '2008-09-19 17:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964674, 721382, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think a more delicate arm (a young girl or child?) would have made the composition more effective.</td>', 'I think a more delicate arm (a young girl or child?) would have made the composition more effective.', '2008-09-19 18:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964883, 722920, 39880, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture, but who would be drinking sewing machine oil?</td>', 'Very cool picture, but who would be drinking sewing machine oil?', '2008-09-19 19:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964947, 722920, 16793, '<td valign="top">My Favorite of the challenge, nice lighting and composed, very clean image..Best of Luck</td>', 'My Favorite of the challenge, nice lighting and composed, very clean image..Best of Luck', '2008-09-19 20:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4964949, 722764, 16793, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, very creative and a standout image</td>', 'Nicely done, very creative and a standout image', '2008-09-19 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965050, 722140, 79955, '<td valign="top">Insufficient contrast</td>', 'Insufficient contrast', '2008-09-19 22:03:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4965069, 722635, 79955, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate that you did not crop neatly while taking the shot. Otherwise excellent concept and well composed 6</td>', 'Unfortunate that you did not crop neatly while taking the shot. Otherwise excellent concept and well composed 6', '2008-09-19 22:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965122, 722635, 98182, '<td valign="top">this is cool but is it water or sand? very good idea tho</td>', 'this is cool but is it water or sand? very good idea tho', '2008-09-19 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965127, 721817, 79955, '<td valign="top">Ncely done, should be right up there at the top of the bunch. Good job! <strike>8</strike>I actually gave you a 9<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-26 01:04:37.</i></td>', 'Ncely done, should be right up there at the top of the bunch. Good job! 8I actually gave you a 9', '2008-09-19 22:57:47.000000', '2008-09-26 02:04:37.000000', 1),
(4965129, 722289, 79955, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!! can''t really explain it. 8</td>', 'Love this shot!! can''t really explain it. 8', '2008-09-19 22:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965192, 722481, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely reflection and how it progresses through the entire image - the long exposure aids the image making the water as smooth as the sky</td>', 'lovely reflection and how it progresses through the entire image - the long exposure aids the image making the water as smooth as the sky', '2008-09-19 23:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965199, 721101, 67152, '<td valign="top">the overlay of close up roses is a nice touch but it seems to have blown out the flowers at smaller size a bit - good idea</td>', 'the overlay of close up roses is a nice touch but it seems to have blown out the flowers at smaller size a bit - good idea', '2008-09-19 23:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965202, 722160, 67152, '<td valign="top">the flow of the water is pretty but the lighting here doesn''t do it justice as the foreground is so bright and the water is a bit too dark - if you could have gotten in closer to the falls and eliminated some of the bright areas, we could have really felt the water move</td>', 'the flow of the water is pretty but the lighting here doesn''t do it justice as the foreground is so bright and the water is a bit too dark - if you could have gotten in closer to the falls and eliminated some of the bright areas, we could have really felt the water move', '2008-09-19 23:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965204, 722887, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice ''triple'' exposure here - the face on the right and left really seem to be tormenting the man</td>', 'nice ''triple'' exposure here - the face on the right and left really seem to be tormenting the man', '2008-09-19 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965205, 720932, 67152, '<td valign="top">the purple artifacts in the corner of the image are a bit distracting, but the details and the star tracks are a nice touch</td>', 'the purple artifacts in the corner of the image are a bit distracting, but the details and the star tracks are a nice touch', '2008-09-20 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965206, 721704, 67152, '<td valign="top">the flow of the spoon is pretty cool - a nice effort for motion in action</td>', 'the flow of the spoon is pretty cool - a nice effort for motion in action', '2008-09-20 00:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965207, 721247, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely scene - the couple look relaxed and tired from a long day - the background being so bright adds to the joy of the moment</td>', 'lovely scene - the couple look relaxed and tired from a long day - the background being so bright adds to the joy of the moment', '2008-09-20 00:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965208, 722861, 67152, '<td valign="top">a delicate low key image - it seems so out of place among all the motion shots - but it is a beautiful simple image</td>', 'a delicate low key image - it seems so out of place among all the motion shots - but it is a beautiful simple image', '2008-09-20 00:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965209, 722559, 67152, '<td valign="top">the sky colors are beautiful and the blue row of lights is such a nice contrast - i just wish the image were a bit sharper so the details on the dome and columns were more pronounced</td>', 'the sky colors are beautiful and the blue row of lights is such a nice contrast - i just wish the image were a bit sharper so the details on the dome and columns were more pronounced', '2008-09-20 00:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965211, 722289, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the perspective here and how the moon provides an eery feel to the whole image</td>', 'love the perspective here and how the moon provides an eery feel to the whole image', '2008-09-20 00:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965212, 722707, 67152, '<td valign="top">the stars in the sky are a cool touch - but the skyline itself seems to have some strange artifacts to it as if it is heavily pixelated</td>', 'the stars in the sky are a cool touch - but the skyline itself seems to have some strange artifacts to it as if it is heavily pixelated', '2008-09-20 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965214, 722768, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool tones and beautiful sky - i like how the light seems to flow out of nothingness in the moving boat - it is just too bad about the small item on the left...</td>', 'cool tones and beautiful sky - i like how the light seems to flow out of nothingness in the moving boat - it is just too bad about the small item on the left...', '2008-09-20 00:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965215, 721191, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice job of panning - this is quite touch and you did a great job here - back for a comment and a bump</td>', 'nice job of panning - this is quite touch and you did a great job here - back for a comment and a bump', '2008-09-20 00:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965223, 722927, 67152, '<td valign="top">the fireworks and the bridge lit up are cool together - i am just not crazy about the people in the foreground...</td>', 'the fireworks and the bridge lit up are cool together - i am just not crazy about the people in the foreground...', '2008-09-20 00:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965224, 721065, 67152, '<td valign="top">the kinetic energy displayed by the headlights contrasting against the loneliness of the bike provide a great contrast</td>', 'the kinetic energy displayed by the headlights contrasting against the loneliness of the bike provide a great contrast', '2008-09-20 00:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965227, 722480, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like how the background is well lit and detailed - i just wish the lighting in the fountain were a bit less blown</td>', 'i like how the background is well lit and detailed - i just wish the lighting in the fountain were a bit less blown', '2008-09-20 00:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965228, 721755, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cool effort - it clearly has a twilight zone feel to it - subtle, but effective</td>', 'a cool effort - it clearly has a twilight zone feel to it - subtle, but effective', '2008-09-20 00:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965229, 722487, 67152, '<td valign="top">the fact that your head almost appears out of nowhere is an interesting aside ot the image...</td>', 'the fact that your head almost appears out of nowhere is an interesting aside ot the image...', '2008-09-20 00:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965233, 722493, 67152, '<td valign="top">the motion of the water is a good idea for the challenge - but the separation from the motion  and the fact that the image seems a bit dark and underexposed takes away a bit</td>', 'the motion of the water is a good idea for the challenge - but the separation from the motion  and the fact that the image seems a bit dark and underexposed takes away a bit', '2008-09-20 00:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965235, 722475, 67152, '<td valign="top">a wild take on long exposure - i think i am getting vertigo here...</td>', 'a wild take on long exposure - i think i am getting vertigo here...', '2008-09-20 00:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965237, 722419, 67152, '<td valign="top">the coloring is a bit too blue for my taste - it almost seems a close up on a portion of the falls - either the foamy part at the top or the delicate section near the bottom would have worked a bit better and allowed the viewer to focus a bit more...<br/> <br/>And the title has to go - we know it is a long exposure from the smoothness of the water and how it is flowing - we don''t need you to remind us what the challenge is....</td>', 'the coloring is a bit too blue for my taste - it almost seems a close up on a portion of the falls - either the foamy part at the top or the delicate section near the bottom would have worked a bit better and allowed the viewer to focus a bit more... And the title has to go - we know it is a long exposure from the smoothness of the water and how it is flowing - we don''t need you to remind us what the challenge is....', '2008-09-20 00:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965241, 722666, 67152, '<td valign="top">good details in the candle and wreath - i just wonder the need to use long exposure here - it seems like a normal studio shot in low light - i am not sure how the long exposure is really making this shot dramatic<br/> <br/>and it is a bit early for me....</td>', 'good details in the candle and wreath - i just wonder the need to use long exposure here - it seems like a normal studio shot in low light - i am not sure how the long exposure is really making this shot dramatic and it is a bit early for me....', '2008-09-20 00:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965243, 722551, 67152, '<td valign="top">the smoothness of the water below is cool to contrast the rocks and trees - but it almost seems that the water fall is the interesting bit and this perspective doesn''t really do the falls justice</td>', 'the smoothness of the water below is cool to contrast the rocks and trees - but it almost seems that the water fall is the interesting bit and this perspective doesn''t really do the falls justice', '2008-09-20 00:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965244, 722158, 67152, '<td valign="top">good job to control exposure to show the flow of the water - i just wonder if even slower shutter speed would have given a smoother feel to the falls...</td>', 'good job to control exposure to show the flow of the water - i just wonder if even slower shutter speed would have given a smoother feel to the falls...', '2008-09-20 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965245, 722765, 67152, '<td valign="top">a neat path for walking at night - it seems to be lacking something though - maybe a couple walking or a solitary individual would have provided a bit of a story to give this a bit more drama</td>', 'a neat path for walking at night - it seems to be lacking something though - maybe a couple walking or a solitary individual would have provided a bit of a story to give this a bit more drama', '2008-09-20 00:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965253, 722566, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice effort of light painting - very subdued and nostalgic feel</td>', 'nice effort of light painting - very subdued and nostalgic feel', '2008-09-20 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965254, 722711, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very pretty shot - doesn''t really scream long exposure to me - especially as it relates to the use of long exposure for dramatic effect</td>', 'a very pretty shot - doesn''t really scream long exposure to me - especially as it relates to the use of long exposure for dramatic effect', '2008-09-20 00:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965256, 722725, 67152, '<td valign="top">the wind in the trees in the background provide a nice eery feel but the background is just too blown</td>', 'the wind in the trees in the background provide a nice eery feel but the background is just too blown', '2008-09-20 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965400, 722757, 90173, '<td valign="top">Probably the best picture in this competition. Great sharp and well taking photo. <br/>10 from me :9</td>', 'Probably the best picture in this competition. Great sharp and well taking photo. 10 from me :9', '2008-09-20 08:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965417, 722487, 90098, '<td valign="top">Oh i dont really know about this one.  Thats crazy though...</td>', 'Oh i dont really know about this one.  Thats crazy though...', '2008-09-20 08:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965418, 722920, 90098, '<td valign="top">I think its pretty cool.</td>', 'I think its pretty cool.', '2008-09-20 08:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965425, 721732, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the trees, nice long exposure on the mist, good focus &amp; color. But, even with all that it''s a factory and not that pleasing to look at so I can''t give it higher than a 6. A different subject and you''ve got all the elements for a higher score.</td>', 'Nice framing with the trees, nice long exposure on the mist, good focus & color. But, even with all that it''s a factory and not that pleasing to look at so I can''t give it higher than a 6. A different subject and you''ve got all the elements for a higher score.', '2008-09-20 09:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965427, 722640, 93756, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the lights. Suggestion to try for another time: crop out the sky and most of the buildings for a neat abstract.</td>', 'I like the colors of the lights. Suggestion to try for another time: crop out the sky and most of the buildings for a neat abstract.', '2008-09-20 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965428, 721478, 67152, '<td valign="top">at night, the ugly underbelly of nature shows up...<br/> <br/>the details and perspective of the flower garden are good here</td>', 'at night, the ugly underbelly of nature shows up... the details and perspective of the flower garden are good here', '2008-09-20 09:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965429, 721382, 93756, '<td valign="top">I love the stars and the idea. The white background is a little boring. Maybe black or a bright color would have grabbed me more.</td>', 'I love the stars and the idea. The white background is a little boring. Maybe black or a bright color would have grabbed me more.', '2008-09-20 09:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965430, 722919, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cool 60s feel to this shot - the tail lights, the weakness of the headlamps, the city below - i just wish the perspective were a bit different - the mountains in the upper left give this an unbalanced feel as if the image is leaning</td>', 'a cool 60s feel to this shot - the tail lights, the weakness of the headlamps, the city below - i just wish the perspective were a bit different - the mountains in the upper left give this an unbalanced feel as if the image is leaning', '2008-09-20 09:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965431, 722918, 93756, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to even see the fish.</td>', 'It''s hard to even see the fish.', '2008-09-20 09:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965432, 720822, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lights burning the sky, the movement of people almost oblivious to the slight, the distorted view of the building and askew road - i just am not sure about the object above the ''light'' a step or two forward may have eliminated this - but may have resulted in you getting run over by a taxi....</td>', 'the lights burning the sky, the movement of people almost oblivious to the slight, the distorted view of the building and askew road - i just am not sure about the object above the ''light'' a step or two forward may have eliminated this - but may have resulted in you getting run over by a taxi....', '2008-09-20 09:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965433, 722575, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting in the far right is almost impossible for us to see at this size - too bad - the image has a lot of potential<br/> <br/>the idea of light painting the tree is a good one to bring out some detail, but it seems to overwhelm the sky a bit</td>', 'the lighting in the far right is almost impossible for us to see at this size - too bad - the image has a lot of potential the idea of light painting the tree is a good one to bring out some detail, but it seems to overwhelm the sky a bit', '2008-09-20 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965435, 722463, 67152, '<td valign="top">the sweepy feel of the clouds is a nice contrast to the cityscape - but i am not a fan of the the choice of composition with the horizon so low</td>', 'the sweepy feel of the clouds is a nice contrast to the cityscape - but i am not a fan of the the choice of composition with the horizon so low', '2008-09-20 09:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965436, 722755, 67152, '<td valign="top">BOO!  A funny shot for the season almost to begin - the color shift from this is actually pretty good - a bit of a bump for humor 6</td>', 'BOO!  A funny shot for the season almost to begin - the color shift from this is actually pretty good - a bit of a bump for humor 6', '2008-09-20 09:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965437, 722563, 93756, '<td valign="top">Neat capture. Lots of action to grab.</td>', 'Neat capture. Lots of action to grab.', '2008-09-20 09:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965438, 722688, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lack of subject really hurts this image - there is nothing for our eyes to be interested in</td>', 'the lack of subject really hurts this image - there is nothing for our eyes to be interested in', '2008-09-20 09:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965439, 721062, 67152, '<td valign="top">i wish the third frog were a bit brighter -but i can understand how the third flash didn''t reach it as well...</td>', 'i wish the third frog were a bit brighter -but i can understand how the third flash didn''t reach it as well...', '2008-09-20 09:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965444, 721488, 67152, '<td valign="top">a cool study in reaction speed - good work and vision to see this</td>', 'a cool study in reaction speed - good work and vision to see this', '2008-09-20 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965446, 722567, 93756, '<td valign="top">I can feel your speed. Kids: don''t try this!</td>', 'I can feel your speed. Kids: don''t try this!', '2008-09-20 09:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965447, 722756, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting, the dynamic angles - they work really well together - the dark tree is a strange one - important for the viewer to see the lines between the posts, but it still seems to upset the remainder of the image and give it a slightly unbalanced feel</td>', 'the lighting, the dynamic angles - they work really well together - the dark tree is a strange one - important for the viewer to see the lines between the posts, but it still seems to upset the remainder of the image and give it a slightly unbalanced feel', '2008-09-20 09:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965448, 722690, 93756, '<td valign="top">I can feel your speed! Great color for no editing!</td>', 'I can feel your speed! Great color for no editing!', '2008-09-20 09:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965450, 722790, 67152, '<td valign="top">a pseudo macro - a good idea to show the smoothness of the water - i just wish it were just a bit brighter...</td>', 'a pseudo macro - a good idea to show the smoothness of the water - i just wish it were just a bit brighter...', '2008-09-20 09:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965451, 722906, 67152, '<td valign="top">the details of the cityscape are actually pretty good but I do not understand  how the title fits - i may be missing something....</td>', 'the details of the cityscape are actually pretty good but I do not understand  how the title fits - i may be missing something....', '2008-09-20 09:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965453, 722636, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool abstract shot and how you placed the light off center to give it more of a kinetic feel</td>', 'cool abstract shot and how you placed the light off center to give it more of a kinetic feel', '2008-09-20 09:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4965454, 721910, 67152, '<td valign="top">the deep rich sepia tones here give this a great feel - dark and forboding</td>', 'the deep rich sepia tones here give this a great feel - dark and forboding', '2008-09-20 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
