(4971027, 720932, 96614, '<td valign="top">This was a long exposure because the stars have some awesome motion... but the parn is taking up almost the entire frame... and it looks like there are two spot lights on either side of the barn causing a purple glow in the pic.  Try just pointing the camera to the sky with a tractor or something in the bottom corner of the frame... this will draw the viewers attention to the stars rather than a large red barn... Nice shot though</td>', 'This was a long exposure because the stars have some awesome motion... but the parn is taking up almost the entire frame... and it looks like there are two spot lights on either side of the barn causing a purple glow in the pic.  Try just pointing the camera to the sky with a tractor or something in the bottom corner of the frame... this will draw the viewers attention to the stars rather than a large red barn... Nice shot though', '2008-09-24 00:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
