(4976490, 722475, 61651, '<td valign="top">Robert, you''re back!  Good to see you in challenges again.  I like this zoom effect - you never know what you''re going to get, so they''re enjoyably serendipitous.  I like that the colors are muted in this one.</td>', 'Robert, you''re back!  Good to see you in challenges again.  I like this zoom effect - you never know what you''re going to get, so they''re enjoyably serendipitous.  I like that the colors are muted in this one.', '2008-09-26 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4976497, 721908, 98401, '<td valign="top">"I wanted to go up to my cottage and point my camera at the north star and leave the shutter open for a couple hours"<br/> <br/>i thought the D50 could only do a 30min. exposure?<br/> <br/>how do you get more out of it?<br/> <br/>oh ya, GRATS on the ribbon!! nice shot<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-26 09:05:59.</i></td>', '"I wanted to go up to my cottage and point my camera at the north star and leave the shutter open for a couple hours" i thought the D50 could only do a 30min. exposure? how do you get more out of it? oh ya, GRATS on the ribbon!! nice shot', '2008-09-26 10:05:17.000000', '2008-09-26 10:05:59.000000', 0),
