(4976515, 721382, 97893, '<td valign="top">Ah! This was one shot that fascinated me, perhaps most, in the long exposure contest. I was so curious to how is it was     done.<br/> <br/>I should congratulate you on this shot. Great work, and highly creative. Please keep on going. Ribbons may come and ribbons may go. :-). But if I could vote (unfortunately it is a member only vote), it would have been a definite 10.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the note on how you shot it.<br/> <br/>Kudos and Cheers!<br/>~vikram</td>', 'Ah! This was one shot that fascinated me, perhaps most, in the long exposure contest. I was so curious to how is it was     done. I should congratulate you on this shot. Great work, and highly creative. Please keep on going. Ribbons may come and ribbons may go. :-). But if I could vote (unfortunately it is a member only vote), it would have been a definite 10. Thanks for the note on how you shot it. Kudos and Cheers!~vikram', '2008-09-26 10:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
