(4976539, 722920, 3936, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue ribbon.<br/> <br/>Very well deserved, what a great shot.  I like that you didn''t try to take it down to the bottom of the glass.  Makes it look like it is just starting.  Very ephemeral effect.  Your fellow "Greeks" are very proud of you.</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue ribbon. Very well deserved, what a great shot.  I like that you didn''t try to take it down to the bottom of the glass.  Makes it look like it is just starting.  Very ephemeral effect.  Your fellow "Greeks" are very proud of you.', '2008-09-26 10:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
