(4976624, 721884, 67152, '<td valign="top">Steve<br/>From the fact that you chose not to tick my comment as helpful, I gather you didn''t like my comment.  Sorry for that but I think it is important to provide accurate comments that reflect actual opinions.  I see that your score was less than hoped for.  I think it is important to remember that just because you work hard to get the shot you like (your photo comments suggest this), it doesn''t necessarily mean that it will translate into a shot that will score well.  <br/> <br/>Overall, it was a nice effort, but again, it was not remarkably dramatic and I see that most voters agreed.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>Peter</td>', 'SteveFrom the fact that you chose not to tick my comment as helpful, I gather you didn''t like my comment.  Sorry for that but I think it is important to provide accurate comments that reflect actual opinions.  I see that your score was less than hoped for.  I think it is important to remember that just because you work hard to get the shot you like (your photo comments suggest this), it doesn''t necessarily mean that it will translate into a shot that will score well.   Overall, it was a nice effort, but again, it was not remarkably dramatic and I see that most voters agreed. Cheers,Peter', '2008-09-26 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 0);
