(4976682, 722837, 66384, '<td valign="top">You got robbed by a bunch of know-it-alls who tried to second guess your exposure time. If they had checked your EXIF data, they would have seen the 1/2 sec. shutter speed. I like the shot and think the moon is lovely, and the silhouette of the trees is just right. I can see the trees clearly on my monitor. (And I can see the full range of shades in the scale below the image on the voting page too. So I think someone else''s monitor needs calibrating.)</td>', 'You got robbed by a bunch of know-it-alls who tried to second guess your exposure time. If they had checked your EXIF data, they would have seen the 1/2 sec. shutter speed. I like the shot and think the moon is lovely, and the silhouette of the trees is just right. I can see the trees clearly on my monitor. (And I can see the full range of shades in the scale below the image on the voting page too. So I think someone else''s monitor needs calibrating.)', '2008-09-26 12:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4976686, 722837, 67152, '<td valign="top">Tim- I liked the shot and gave it a 6 during voting.  I am surprized that you were able to get that clear of a shot of the moon with 1/2 second - good to know for future work.  I wish the sky were just a bit brighter to really bring out more of the tree line.  <br/></td>', 'Tim- I liked the shot and gave it a 6 during voting.  I am surprized that you were able to get that clear of a shot of the moon with 1/2 second - good to know for future work.  I wish the sky were just a bit brighter to really bring out more of the tree line.  ', '2008-09-26 12:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4976717, 721817, 63244, '<td valign="top">This lived up to my expectations!!!  Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'This lived up to my expectations!!!  Congrats on your ribbon.', '2008-09-26 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4976718, 721908, 50578, '<td valign="top">Nice job,  I did this for a challenge about 2 years ago, recently I went out and did it with my Honda Scooter  I held the tripod between my knees.  got a couple of photos that look ok,  Will add them to my portfolio soon.</td>', 'Nice job,  I did this for a challenge about 2 years ago, recently I went out and did it with my Honda Scooter  I held the tripod between my knees.  got a couple of photos that look ok,  Will add them to my portfolio soon.', '2008-09-26 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
