(4976731, 722690, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot and I was really curious how it was done. To be a little nit picky (and that''s all it is) too bad the left hand mirror wasn''t turned to show the road. I am guessing its set just fine for driving though. (Safety first of course!)<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'Really cool shot and I was really curious how it was done. To be a little nit picky (and that''s all it is) too bad the left hand mirror wasn''t turned to show the road. I am guessing its set just fine for driving though. (Safety first of course!) Well done!', '2008-09-26 13:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
